DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTSTAMP:20260907T161722Z
UID:0667197999f55552dfddc1f1f259@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The Hartford.com Salsa Socials are one of the most beloved and
  anticipated annual summer events held in downtown Hartford. Join the fun 
 as Pratt Street comes alive with the sites and sounds of Salsa music. Unli
 ke a concert or performance event - everyone who comes to a Hartford.com S
 alsa Social becomes a part of the experience. Dancers\, kids\, grandparent
 s\, professional instructors\, and the audience all experience the energy 
 and celebration of cultural pride. This event is free and open to the publ
 ic.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/hartfordcom-salsa-socials
