 ne too tense\, Felix seems suicidal\, but as the action unfolds\, Oscar be
 comes the one with murder on his mind when the clean freak and the slob ul
 timately decide to room together. The action unfolds with hilarious result
 s as The Odd Couple is born.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/odd-cou
 ple-0
